## 🔴 Two: Before Changing Code

```bash
# A: Declare scope
bash scripts/scope-check.sh declare "What you're doing"

# B: Scan impact
grep -rn "thing-youre-changing" --include="*.py" --include="*.ts" .

# C: List affected modules, confirm sync plan
```

**After changes:**
```bash
bash scripts/scope-check.sh verify  # Check for scope violations
```

