## 🔴 Four: Forbidden

- ❌ Say "OK" without command output
- ❌ Claim "updated" without actually writing files
- ❌ Skip scope declaration
- ❌ Change shared modules without full grep
- ❌ Delete files without checking docker-compose.yml/Makefile references
- ❌ `git checkout --` (discards uncommitted work)
- ❌ New root-level .md/.sql files (put in docs/ or sql/)

