## 🔴 Five: End of Day Ritual

1. **Git push** — all changes committed and pushed
2. **Update changelog** — record today's work
3. **Update decision log** — record any technical decisions
4. **Generate snapshot** — `SNAPSHOT_YYYY-MM-DD.md` in docs/
5. **Update related docs** — code changes → document updates
6. **Sync to backup location** — if configured
7. **Verify + report** — `bash scripts/verify-project.sh --quick` → tell user

**Report template:**
> "EOD ✅ | Changed: [summary] | Changelog: [updated/skip] | Git: [pushed/⚠️N pending] | Verify: [✅N ⚠️N ❌N]"

